<p>
            AI Usage Statement:
            </p>
            <p>
            The creation of this workbook involved a blend of traditional authorship and modern digital tools. While the pedagogical design, scope, and mathematical verification are entirely my own, I utilized Google's Gemini 1.5 Pro (2026) as a formatting and editorial assistant. 
        </p>
        <p>
            Gemini helped convert raw text files into clean PreTeXt syntax, construct TikZ code for visuals/graphs, and expand details for provided solutions. I also used Gemini to brainstorm problem contexts, updating classic probability questions to better match the interests of today's students.
        </p>
  </acknowledgement>



  
